					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "POLYGON\n\nThe Polygon node converts a Float 2 collection into a polygon shape.\n\nNote that to actually see anything this collection needs to have at least 3 values.\n\nThe first element of the Float 2 sets the X-position of the points and the second element the Y-position."
					}
				},
